{'symbol': 'TWTR', 'date': '2022-02-11 08:00:00', 'title': 'TWITTER, INC. ANNOUNCES $2 BILLION ACCELERATED SHARE REPURCHASE AGREEMENTS', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO, FEB. 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TWITTER, INC. ("TWITTER" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: TWTR) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS ENTERED INTO ACCELERATED SHARE REPURCHASE AGREEMENTS (ASRS) WITH MORGAN STANLEY & CO. LLC AND WELLS FARGO BANK, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION (COLLECTIVELY, THE "DEALERS") TO REPURCHASE $2 BILLION OF THE COMPANY\'S COMMON STOCK.\xa0 THE ASRS WERE ENTERED INTO PURSUANT TO TWITTER\'S RECENTLY ANNOUNCED SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM, UNDER WHICH APPROXIMATELY $2 BILLION OF SHARE REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION WILL REMAIN AVAILABLE UPON COMPLETION OF THE ASRS.'}